---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Retro Events | CCG Eleventy Prototype
description: Explore retro gaming events, visits and related features from Cheeky Commodore Gamer in the lightweight Eleventy prototype.
permalink: /games/collections/retro-events/index.html
---
<section class="hero hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">COLLECTION PROTOTYPE</p>
  <h1>{{ collectionArchive.retroEvents.name }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ collectionArchive.retroEvents.description }}</p>
</section>

<section class="archive-browser" aria-labelledby="retro-events-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="retro-events-heading">Retro events and features</h2>
    <p>{{ collectionArchive.retroEvents.entries | length }} entries preserved from the existing <code>retro-events.json</code> source. Demo-music records in that source remain owned by the dedicated music archive.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="collection-list">
    {% for entry in collectionArchive.retroEvents.entries %}
      <article class="collection-summary">
        <h3><a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>
          {% if entry.badge %}{{ entry.badge }} · {% endif %}
          {% if entry.membersOnly %}Members-only video{% else %}CCG video{% endif %}
        </p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
